---
source: crates/specforge-cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Coverage gaps around an entity, or of the whole project

Usage: specforge review [OPTIONS] [ENTITY]

Arguments:
  [ENTITY]
          Entity ID to review (omit to review the whole project)

Options:
      --path <PATH>
          Path to the spec root directory
          
          [default: .]

      --depth <DEPTH>
          Hops around the entity
          
          [default: 1]

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: human or json
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help
